{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"2788","title":"Xiaomi Redefines Modern-living with a Wide Array of AIoT Products","desc":"Robot vacuum, the brand’s first-ever wet dry vacuum series, TV, smart band, and tablet have landed to bring next-level excitement to every facet of living ","view_cnt":"11498","like_cnt":"2","add_time":"1664532359","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/229_operatorx_operatorx_opx/30/09/2022/4a514c9a0a16364340b0806a5cc8f1ef.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eMunich, GERMANY, October 4, 2022 –\u0026nbsp;Xiaomi today announced the international release of a wide selection of AIoT products to elevate daily life - introducing\u0026nbsp; Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X10+, Xiaomi Truclean W10 Wet Dry Vacuum Series, Xiaomi TV Q2 Series, Xiaomi Smart Band 7 Pro, and Redmi Pad.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/728_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/09/2022/216944ce7de035a180466fb81554a208.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eExtreme cleaning, extraordinarily automated: Xiaomi Robot Vacuum X10+\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X10+, the latest in Xiaomi's robot vacuum lineup, is designed to help make cleaning easy. Paired with its intelligent base station, the device can empty trash in its dustbin, clean mop pads, refill the water tank, keep its mopping cloth moist, and self-dry to avoid moisture retention and odors when the machine is not in use. This is true automation all the way, bringing every household a seamless cleaning experience.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eThis multifaceted cleaning device is also specially-adapted to clean every floor type. The mop can lift itself when the in-built ultrasonic sensor automatically detects carpets, while picking up dust particles thoroughly with 4,000Pa suction power.\u003c/span\u003e¹\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e The dual spinning mop pads can perform pressurized mopping to remove stubborn floor stains. This all-rounded cleaning companion delivers whole-household cleaning in one go, allowing tech-savvy consumers to free themselves from time-consuming and repetitive housework after a busy working day.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X10+ is powered by the patented S-Cross AITM\u0026nbsp;system, enabling it to avoid every object on its cleaning path with perfect-finish mopping. The machine also comes with a dual-line laser and an RGB camera for target detection. Together with the LDS navigation, the appliance will plan an efficient cleaning route, no matter the household's size and configuration.The machine is TÜV Rheinland-certified according to their cybersecurity and privacy protection standards, ensuring your privacy.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X10+ is available for sale starting from EUR 899\u0026nbsp;via Xiaomi’s official channels. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/636_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/09/2022/dbd955234b3388221378608b352f7ebd.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eTruly clean in one go: Xiaomi Truclean W10 Wet Dry Vacuum Series\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eAs the brand’s first-ever wet dry vacuum lineup, Xiaomi Truclean W10 Wet Dry Vacuum Series is designed to bring an impeccable cleaning experience to every household. The series comes with two handheld models - Xiaomi Truclean W10 Ultra Wet Dry Vacuum and Xiaomi Truclean W10 Pro Wet Dry Vacuum; both are cleaning maestros with three functions - vacuuming, mopping, and scrubbing. Powered by an intelligent dirt detection system, the in-built adaptive function enables the device to adjust the cleaning power automatically based on the amount of dust being identified. Any mess, no matter if it is a puddle of liquid waste or pet hair left by your dearest furry friend can disappear with just one click.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eUnderstanding that every household has a different configuration, and its unique preferences when it comes to cleaning, that’s why Xiaomi offers two models under this series to suit your needs. On one hand, Xiaomi Truclean W10 Ultra Wet Dry Vacuum is equipped with a 75°C\u003c/span\u003e²\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;high-temperature cleaning mode that can provide a more thorough cleaning session. It can also self-clean, refill with water, and dry itself automatically with an all-in-one smart base station.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eOn the other hand, Xiaomi Truclean W10 Pro Wet Dry Vacuum is the ultimate companion for households with hard-to-reach corners and edges. Cleaning is a cakewalk with the device’s specifically designed tangle-free roller brush that can cover larger spaces and has a 90-degree adjustable handle that helps clean below most furniture effectively.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi Truclean W10 Wet Dry Vacuum Series is available for sale starting from EUR 599 via Xiaomi’s official channels.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/249_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/09/2022/1d49a10b382693b86eed9e7953fec99a.png\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/329_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/09/2022/ad194398156062502bcc2984b00fdae2.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eUnlock quantum immersion: Xiaomi TV Q2 Series\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eThe latest Xiaomi TV Q2 Series will provide an exceptional picture quality to viewers with its latest Quantum Dot Display technology, which comes in 3 different sizes. This 4K Ultra-HD resolution equipped high-end TV is meant to highlight every visual experience with vivid, life-like colors and smoother transitions during fast-motion scenes for supreme visual entertainment.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eTogether with Dolby Vision\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: 微软雅黑, arial, sans-serif\"\u003e™\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;IQ and Dolby Atmos\u003c/span\u003e®\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e, the powerful audiovisual duo, along with the TV’s ambient light sensors, Xiaomi TV Q2 Series can intelligently detect environmental brightness and make corresponding adjustments to the picture while delivering stunning audio performance seamlessly at the same time. Bringing every audiovisual enthusiast an immersive cinematic experience.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eNot to mention the in-built Google TV system, a first for the Xiaomi TV series, which will provide viewers with tailor-selected content and endless sources of entertainment. The TV array also serves as a smart home control hub with Google Assistant,\u003c/span\u003e³\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e enabling every household to control parts of their home with just their voice. The series also comes with Xiaomi TV+ app pre-installed, giving viewers more content options, ranging from live TV to blockbusters. Everything you need is here, all on one screen.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi TV Q2 Series is available for sale starting from EUR 599\u0026nbsp;via Xiaomi’s official channels. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/181_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/09/2022/01b9c4bc8dc3983704a34634d00d83a0.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eStep up your style: Xiaomi Smart Band 7 Pro\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eEquipped with a high-resolution 1.64” retangular AMOLED screen, Xiaomi Smart Band 7 Pro enhances every discerning user’s viewing experience in a much more convenient and pleasurable way, through its enlarged viewing area and auto-brightness function, without sacrificing its aesthetic details.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eRanging from sleep monitoring to sports tracking, Xiaomi Smart Band 7 Pro offers over 110 sports modes that can fulfill any user's particular tracking needs. New to the popular smart band series is the built-in GNSS system, enabling faster positioning and more accurate route tracking, making it the ideal gear for all on-the-go sports enthusiasts. This device features 5ATM resistance\u003c/span\u003e⁴\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;and a battery life topping up to 12 days; it helps you receive any call and message, anytime, anywhere.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eWhen it comes to the design, the wearable has over 150 in-app watch faces, 2 band colors with 8 different strap options\u003c/span\u003e⁵\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;in a pleasingly tactile form. This well-rounded gadget serves as a \"must-have'' addition to the wardrobe of any fashionista that wants to complement a sharp business look, go to a party at night or look great on a hike.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 7 Pro is available for sale starting from EUR 99 via Xiaomi’s official channels. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/343_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/09/2022/f64d35c1846976988ab9636eb493a708.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eAll in one, pad for fun: Redmi Pad\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eKey to Redmi Pad’s immersive audiovisual experience are quad speakers equipped with Dolby Atmos\u003c/span\u003e®\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;and a 90Hz refresh rate. Featuring a 10.61\" display and lower visual latency, the device is designed to elevate your viewing experience, and is the first tablet in the world to receive SGS low visual fatigue certification. Additionally, Redmi Pad has been accredited with low light certification by TÜV Rheinland, so your eyes are well protected and you feel more comfortable even when binge-watching. With an 8MP 105° ultra-wide front camera and FocusFrame technology,\u003c/span\u003e⁶\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e the device is perfectly calibrated for group video calls to make sure no one is left out.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003ePowered with a long-lasting 8,000mAh battery and equipped with 22.5W in-box charger supporting 18W fast charging, Redmi Pad ensures endless fun for marathon gaming, movie watching or even hours-long photo shooting.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eRedmi Pad is available for sale starting from EUR 279\u0026nbsp;via Xiaomi’s official channels. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/969_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/30/09/2022/c213475af36a5345ddd628da7bc888ee.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eProduct images available here: \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EnSma4GFvhtMrAGSY-R0oxYBhSlfhTiOSFNY_bn7m9n_Sg?e=5E86d0\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi Robot Vacuum X10+\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EhQIt0KvXq1CqnzI6c7AXKMBfLLVeWVMYAZZkFjUKULFQA?e=Iz8dKD\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi Truclean W10 Pro Wet Dry Vacuum\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EpO3aL7Xa-1AposMA1BDqHEB6IAB3G0XF2PtRgaV8ZkRaA?e=ydPIgT\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi Truclean W10 Ultra Wet Dry Vacuum\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EleNqDxyO-dGorSRlteW6v0B7sXXTvBJ5UDCSA9yrz1o6g?e=L8vvg3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi TV Q2 Series\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e, \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EpI8DT3SKodMg3RI72F92S0BZiQkR62mM-DwPE2uU7hlbA?e=AhiRgl\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eXiaomi Smart Band 7 Pro\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e, and \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/EuURSDXyYVxAntallJlgDYUB7_MVk-huDhObyP0ByyMjcw?e=2SIfL4\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eRedmi Pad\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e¹ \u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eData retrieved from internal test carried out by the manufacturer, full test report can be provided if requested.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e² \u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e75°C in the water tank of the central unit when in high-temperature cleaning mode and the surroundings are at room temperature. Data is taken from Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e³\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Please refer to Google Assistant official website for more info.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e⁴\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e 5 ATM water resistance rating based on ISO standard 22810:2010\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e⁵\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e Availability varies by market.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e⁶ \u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003eFocusFrame will be available via OTA update, and only available on certain applications.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Arial\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAbout Xiaomi\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi Corporation (“Xiaomi”) was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://1810.HK\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e1810.HK\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience, and operational efficiency. The company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAccording to Canalys, the company’s market share in terms of smartphone shipments ranked No. 3 globally in the second quarter of 2022. The company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, with 526.9 million smart devices connected to its platform as of June 30, 2022, excluding smartphones, tablets, and laptops. Xiaomi products are available in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In August 2022, the company made the Fortune Global 500 list for the fourth time, ranking 266th, up 72 places compared to 2021.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eFor more information about Xiaomi as a company, please visit \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/discover/newsroom\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ehttps://www.mi.com/global/discover/newsroom\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]; font-family: Calibri\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"17401","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1664888400"},"common":null}